SUMMARY:✈️ Arrival day — SJD → Casa Afortunada
LOCATION:Los Cabos International Airport (SJD)\, San José del Cabo\, Mexic
 o
DESCRIPTION:Fly into Los Cabos (SJD)\, then a private Sprinter van transfer
  to the house.\n\nMost guests: Southwest WN630\, SNA → SJD.\nRyan: Ameri
 can AA2547\, DFW → SJD.\n\nTransfer: RC Five Star Sedans & Limos\, Whats
 App +52 624 205 4240.\nHost: Nicolas Radisay\, 949 338 0792.\n\nBring your
  passport and have pesos for tips.
