SUMMARY:🏖️ Free day — optional excursions
LOCATION:Los Barriles\, Baja California Sur\, Mexico
DESCRIPTION:No meals or activities included — the flex day of the week.\n
 \nIdeas: sport fishing\, a Cabo Pulmo snorkel trip\, RZR runs up the arroy
 os\,\nextra pickleball at Palmas Pickleball Resort\, or nothing at all by 
 the pool.\n\nDinner is on your own. Book excursions ahead — ask your hos
 ts for help.
