SUMMARY:💀 Día de los Muertos Dinner — Chef Rogelio + Pepon live
LOCATION:Casa Afortunada\, Los Barriles\, Baja California Sur\, Mexico
DESCRIPTION:The big one. Five courses from Chef Rogelio Granado — appetiz
 ers\, salad\,\nSonoran-style beef or catch of the day\, sides and dessert 
 — with live music\nfrom Pepon: classic rock\, reggae\, blues\, and 80s t
 o now.\n\nAttire: Día de los Muertos theme. Bring something festive — f
 ace paint\,\na floral crown\, marigold colours\, an embroidered shirt.
